  ('7c1d2e3f-4a5b-4c6d-8e9f-0a1b2c3d4e5f', 'List 3 factors you need to know if you want to calculate how long it takes to fill an Olympic-sized swimming pool with a garden hose. How would you use them?', 'video', '[["Now suppose the pool has a small leak at the bottom that loses water continuously. How would you re-evaluate the problem? Does your solution change — which of your three factors are affected, and would you add or replace any?"]]'::jsonb, true, 30, 180, 1),
  ('7c1d2e3f-4a5b-4c6d-8e9f-0a1b2c3d4e5f', 'List 3 factors you need to know if you want to calculate how many buses a city of 3 million people needs during the morning rush hour. How would you use them?', 'video', '[["Now suppose the city opens a new subway line that runs along the busiest bus route. How would you re-evaluate the problem? Does your solution change — which of your three factors are affected, and would you add or replace any?"]]'::jsonb, true, 30, 180, 2),
